     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Mon, Jul 21, 2014 at 6:06 PM, Michael Betancourt <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">betan...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n</div></div>"
