   "parts": [
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">On Monday, July 21, 2014 11:03:25 PM UTC-4, Peter Li wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">There might be some issue with how we&#39;re calling it from the python script then [we&#39;re not using PyStan], though I think I saw similar variations when I ran it straight from command line. It might be the seeds since I don&#39;t think we set them to anything particular, but I don&#39;t see why that would give so much variation in the warmup times. </div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
