  },
  {
   "id": "eArrV-nt3UoJ",
   "from": "Peter Li",
   "author": "839dfa09184985a5",
   "date": "2014-07-22T03:56:31Z",
   "subject": "Re: [stan-dev] Re: Running Chains in Parallel",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">So if I run the model for 100 runs, 4 chains each, the 4 chains in each run should have the same seed, but from run to run they should have different seeds?</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">\r\nOn Mon, Jul 21, 2014 at 11:34 PM, Ben Goodrich <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">goodri...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
